Hi,
I just updated the game and I want to let you what I added, changed or removed.

New methods in crafting:
- a method to create explosive powder (from ammonium nitrate and sulfur);
- a method to create plastic (from carbon monoxide + hydrogen + titanium (catalyst));
- a method to create electronic parts (from plastic + copper);
- a method to create an electric heater (to make water and hydrogen);

I also added:
- a better way to transfer the items from Package and hand in the inventory (using double-click);
- a button to empty the bags and tanks;
- titanium in rocks;

Fixes:
- bug at health and oxygen was fixed;
- bug at rocks was fixed;
- + few more bugs;

Changes:
- number of generated rocks (from 45-75 to 100-250);
- stamina is not decreasing anymore when you are walking;
- building system was also modified;
- now you can craft directly from the package (you are looking into a package);
- the electric heater was modified, now you can make hydrogen and water, not only water;
- the o2 generator was also modified, now you can get oxygen and carbon monoxide from it;

