!!! WARNING: Backup the Saves and Settings folders. After each update, they can disappear. !!!

Hi,
In this update, I just fixed some bugs and added a panel with "Instructions".

Fixed bugs:
- at oxygen status + tank;
- at wind turbine;
- at UI (inventory + resolution);
- at the spacecraft (glitch at the ceiling);
- at the crafting (0 items required for Wind Turbine);
- + few more;

New things:
- a slider to see if you are crafting;
- a panel with "Instructions";

A big update will come next week. I will try to add new things like:
- drilling machine;
- rover;
- rovScanner (you can use it to scan the ground for metals/ores/resources);
- a computer in your base or spacecraft to contact the Earth and buy things (resupply missions);
- 2 new models for the base;
- a bed;
- a dome;
- a small vehicle for transporting the rocks;
- weight to the inventory;
+ few more things;

Best regards,
Cristi

